# [MiSTer-DB9 BEGIN] - freeze upstream workflow files on merge
# The default GITHUB_TOKEN used by sync-jotego-upstream.yaml cannot push
# .github/workflows/* or .gitea/workflows/* changes, so keep our version of
# any workflow file upstream edits (the sync workflow registers
# merge.ours.driver and also drops upstream-added workflow files post-merge).
# .gitea/workflows covers jotego's GH Actions to Gitea Actions migration.
# These files are disabled via the Actions API regardless, so their content
# is irrelevant here. merge=ours only covers modify/modify conflicts;
# rename/delete and modify/delete (the actual shape of the Gitea migration)
# are handled by the auto-resolve fallback in "Merge upstream".
.github/workflows/* merge=ours
.gitea/workflows/* merge=ours
# [MiSTer-DB9 END]